                    "message": {
                        "text": "Do not place Android context classes in static fields (static reference to AppUpdates which has field context pointing to Context); this is a memory leak",
                        "markdown": "Do not place Android context classes in static fields (static reference to `AppUpdates` which has field `context` pointing to `Context`); this is a memory leak"
                    },
